@startuml
title Save Collected Entry - Sequence Diagram
actor Contributor
participant "App (CustomTkinter)" as App
participant "dataset.py" as Dataset
participant "audio_utils.py" as Audio
database "dataset.csv" as CSV
participant "audio/ directory" as AudioDir

Contributor -> App : Fill form and click Save
App -> App : Read text and metadata
App -> App : Reject empty text
App -> Dataset : append_entry(entry)
Dataset -> Dataset : ensure_dataset_file()
Dataset -> CSV : Append DictWriter row
CSV --> Dataset : File write complete
Dataset --> App : Return
App -> Dataset : total_count()
Dataset -> CSV : Read rows
CSV --> Dataset : Entries
Dataset --> App : Count
App --> Contributor : Show saved status and refresh UI

opt Audio attached before save
  Contributor -> App : Record or attach file
  App -> Audio : save_recording()/attach_file()
  Audio -> AudioDir : Write copied/generated file
  AudioDir --> Audio : Filename
  Audio --> App : pending_audio_path
end
@enduml
